# CS149 Assignment 1 — build artifacts & local tooling
# Mirrors each prog's `make clean` (objs/, binaries, *.ppm, *~, …)

# ── Object trees (prog1, prog3–6: OBJDIR=objs) ─────────────────────────────
**/objs/

# ── prog2: flat build (no objs/) ───────────────────────────────────────────
prog2_vecintrin/myexp
prog2_vecintrin/*.o

# ── Linked executables (Makefile APP_NAME) ───────────────────────────────────
prog1_mandelbrot_threads/mandelbrot
prog3_mandelbrot_ispc/mandelbrot_ispc
prog4_sqrt/sqrt
prog5_saxpy/saxpy
prog6_kmeans/kmeans

# ── Runtime / visualization output ─────────────────────────────────────────
*.ppm
prog6_kmeans/*.log
prog6_kmeans/*.png

# ── clangd / bear (regenerate locally; not for version control) ─────────────
**/compile_commands.json
**/.cache/

# ── Editor backups ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*~
*.swp
*.swo

# ── OS junk ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# ── Python (prog6 plot.py) ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
